# Fortune, Loyal Steed has Saddle 1 (CR 702.171a): the creatures tapped must have total power 1 or more. A Wall of Wood (power 0)
# alone cannot pay it, so that saddle is refused, but a Thraben Inspector (power 1) alone can: Fortune becomes saddled and on
# turn 3 its attack trigger and end-of-combat blink work, returning the Inspector (a second Clue) while the Wall stays untapped.

